>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/rw-volcanoes.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Quick escape · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Gorillas in a Weekend</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>3 days · 2 nights</b></span>
        <span>Volcanoes NP · Fly-in</span>
        <span>Permit included</span>
        <span>from <b>$2,400</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Gorillas%20in%20a%20Weekend" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="index.html#experiences">Quick escapes</a> / Gorillas in a Weekend</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Already in the region? You're closer to the mountain gorillas than you think. Fly to Kigali, drive into the misty Volcanoes National Park, spend a soul-stirring hour with a gorilla family, and be home by Sunday — a bucket-list moment in a single weekend.</p>
        <p>Designed for residents and short-stay travellers, with the gorilla permit, lodge and transfers all arranged. Trekking is for ages 15 and up; permits are limited, so we book early.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your weekend</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Fri</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to Kigali, drive to the volcanoes</h3><p>Arrive in Kigali and transfer about two and a half hours through the terraced hills to a lodge at the foot of the Virungas. Settle in, with a briefing for the trek ahead.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sat</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Gorilla trekking</h3><p>An early briefing with traditional dancing, then into the forest with trackers ahead for a regulated, unforgettable hour with a mountain gorilla family. The afternoon is yours to rest, or track the golden monkeys.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sun</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return to Kigali &amp; fly home</h3><p>A relaxed morning, then the scenic drive back to Kigali for your flight home — heart full, weekend well spent.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Two nights at a hand-picked lodge</li>
          <li>One Rwanda gorilla permit</li>
          <li>All private transfers from Kigali</li>
          <li>Expert driver-guide &amp; ranger fees</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$2,400 per person sharing</strong> including the gorilla permit; international flights to Kigali extra (we can add these). The premium permit drives the price — Uganda is a more affordable alternative. Minimum age 15; best in the drier months.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Gorillas, by Sunday.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and we'll secure your permit — they're limited and go fast.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Gorillas%20in%20a%20Weekend" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More escapes</p><h2 class="section__title">Other quick escapes</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="weekend-mara.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-cheetah.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>A Weekend in the Mara</h3><p>3 days · fly-in safari.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="swahili-coast-escape.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-lamu.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Swahili Coast Escape</h3><p>3 days · the Indian Ocean.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="gorillas-of-the-volcanoes.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/rw-nyungwe.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Gorillas of the Volcanoes</h3><p>4 days · the full Rwanda trek.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

